cyclotomic polynomials: degrees, products X^n - 1 (n < 80), Phi_15, the coefficient -2 of Phi_105: right
X^j modulo Phi_d: equal to long division for d in 1, 3, 5, 9, 15, 21, 27, 45, 63, 105
